  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed first floor rear extension would result in an\r\ninappropriate roof form that would intersect the proposed rear dormer. The\r\nproposed first floor rear extension and rear dormer, given their prominent location\r\nto the rear of the host property at first floor and roof level, would result in\r\nan unduly obtrusive and incongruous addition to the original dwellinghouse,\r\nfailing to respect the character and proportions of the dwellinghouse and the\r\nvisual amenities of the locality. The proposal would therefore be contrary to\r\nthe high-quality design aspiration of the National Planning Policy Framework\r\n(2024), Policies D1, D3, D4 of The London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of the\r\nHarrow’s Local Plan (2021-2041) and the relevant provisions of the adopted\r\nHarrow Supplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
